        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "HTTP Request - LINE Push Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1200, 350]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### [Demo] Expense Report & Monthly Summary\n\n**Part 1 (top):** Notion expense form submitted -> normalize fields -> append to Google Sheets ledger (real-time)\n\n**Part 2 (bottom):** Monthly schedule (1st @ 09:00) -> read Google Sheets -> summarize by category -> LINE push monthly report to finance manager\n\n---\n\n【Demo】財會表單串接：(上) Notion 費用表單 → 即時寫入 Google Sheets 帳本 (下) 每月1號自動匯總當月支出 → LINE 推播月報給財務負責人。共用元件：Notion Trigger、Set 格式化、Cron 排程、LINE 推播",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 400
      },
